            "type": "ref",
            "id": "943dfd55-ad09-5abf-9138-95a6149d3302"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " condition. Snow doesn't impair your vision; you ignore concealment from snowfall. Your skin becomes cold to the touch, and sometimes frost forms on you. You are protected from severe cold and heat."
          }
        ]
      }
